(13,13,1,'Project handover memo (sales to operations)','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">PROJECT HANDOVER MEMO</h2><p><b>To:</b> {{project.pm}}, Project Manager; Warehouse and Delivery<br><b>From:</b> {{project.preparer}}<br><b>Re:</b> {{project.title}} ({{project.no}})</p><p>The contract below was awarded to the company by {{entity.name}} (notice of award {{project.noa_ref}}, {{project.noa_date}}). Please mobilize as follows:</p>{{lines.contract_table}}<table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:32%\">Delivery site</td><td>{{project.delivery_site}}</td></tr><tr><td>Due</td><td>{{project.due_date}}</td></tr><tr><td>End-user</td><td>{{project.end_user}}</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>{{project.warranty_months}}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Deliveries are recorded on Deliveries &amp; Acceptance; the signed delivery receipt and the inspection and acceptance report are filed in the Document Vault, as billing depends on them.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{project.preparer}}</div><div>Handed over by</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{project.pm}}</div><div>Received by</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(14,14,1,'Delivery receipt','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">DELIVERY RECEIPT</h2><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:24%\">DR no.</td><td><b>{{delivery.no}}</b></td><td style=\"width:20%\">Date</td><td>{{delivery.date}}</td></tr><tr><td>Delivered to</td><td colspan=\"3\">{{entity.name}}, {{delivery.to}}</td></tr><tr><td>Project</td><td colspan=\"3\">{{project.title}} (contract / PO {{project.contract_ref}})</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>{{delivery.table}}<p>Received the above items in good order and condition, subject to inspection and acceptance by the entity.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Delivered by ({{company.name}})</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{delivery.received_by}} {{delivery.received_position}}</div><div>Received by (name, position, date)</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(15,15,1,'Service / accomplishment report','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">SERVICE / ACCOMPLISHMENT REPORT</h2><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:32%\">Project</td><td><b>{{project.title}}</b></td></tr><tr><td>Reference (PR / RFQ / ITB)</td><td>{{project.reference_no}}</td></tr><tr><td>Procuring entity</td><td>{{entity.name}}</td></tr><tr><td>Mode of procurement</td><td>{{project.mode}}</td></tr><tr><td>Approved budget (ABC)</td><td>{{project.abc}}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Period covered: [from] to [to]</p>{{delivery.table}}<h3>Work done</h3><p>[Describe the services rendered / work accomplished, with dates.]</p><h3>Issues and actions</h3><p>[None]</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{project.pm}}</div><div>Submitted by</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{entity.end_user}}</div><div>Certified by the end-user</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(16,16,1,'Transmittal letter','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">TRANSMITTAL</h2><p><b>{{entity.head_name}}</b><br>{{entity.head_position}}<br>{{entity.name}}<br>{{entity.address}}</p><p><b>Attention:</b> The Chairperson, Bids and Awards Committee  ({{entity.bac_chair}})</p><p><b>Re: {{project.title}}</b></p><p>We transmit the following documents for your appropriate action:</p><table class=\"ft\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:6%\">No.</th><th>Document</th><th style=\"width:16%\">Copies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>[Document]</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>[Document]</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Kindly acknowledge receipt by signing below.</p><div>{{signatories}}</div><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Received by (name, position)</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Date and time received</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(17,17,1,'Billing cover letter / request for payment','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><p><b>{{entity.head_name}}</b><br>{{entity.head_position}}<br>{{entity.name}}<br>{{entity.address}}</p><p><b>Attention:</b> The Chairperson, Bids and Awards Committee  ({{entity.bac_chair}})</p><p><b>Subject: Request for payment, {{billing.type}} {{billing.no}} for {{project.title}}</b></p><p>Dear Sir / Madam:</p><p>We respectfully request payment of <b>{{billing.gross}}</b> ({{billing.gross_words}}) for the deliveries / services accepted under {{project.contract_ref}}, as detailed below:</p>{{billing.table}}<p>Enclosed are our sales invoice no. {{billing.si_no}}, the statement of account, and the signed delivery and inspection and acceptance documents.</p><p>Payment may be made by check payable to <b>{{company.name}}</b> or by credit to: {{company.bank_details}}. Kindly furnish us BIR Form 2307 for the taxes withheld.</p><div>{{signatories}}</div>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(18,18,1,'Statement of account','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT</h2><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:24%\">Bill to</td><td><b>{{entity.name}}</b><br>{{entity.address}}</td></tr><tr><td>Project</td><td>{{project.title}} ({{project.no}})</td></tr><tr><td>Contract / PO</td><td>{{project.contract_ref}}, {{project.contract_amount}}</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p>{{soa.table}}<p>Please make payment to {{company.name}}: {{company.bank_details}}.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Prepared by</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{signatory.name}}</div><div>Noted by</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(19,19,1,'Collection follow-up letter','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><p><b>{{entity.treasurer}}</b><br>Treasurer<br>{{entity.name}}<br>{{entity.address}}</p><p><b>Subject: Follow-up of payment, {{project.title}}</b></p><p>Dear Sir / Madam:</p><p>May we respectfully follow up the payment of our billing for the above project, which has been accepted and is now due. Our records show the following:</p>{{soa.table}}<p>Should any document be lacking for the processing of the payment, please let us know so we can provide it at once.</p><div>{{signatories}}</div>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(20,20,1,'Acknowledgment receipt (supplementary)','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">ACKNOWLEDGMENT RECEIPT</h2><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:26%\">No.</td><td>{{collection.no}}</td><td style=\"width:16%\">Date</td><td>{{collection.date}}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Received from <b>{{entity.name}}</b> the amount of <b>{{collection.amount_words}} ({{collection.amount}})</b> by {{collection.reference}}, in payment of billing {{billing.no}} (sales invoice no. {{billing.si_no}}) for {{project.title}}.</p>{{collection.table}}<p style=\"margin-top:14px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;border:1px solid #000;padding:6px\">THIS DOCUMENT IS NOT VALID FOR CLAIM OF INPUT TAX.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:100%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Received by (cashier / collector)</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(21,21,1,'Contract reconciliation sheet','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">CONTRACT RECONCILIATION SHEET</h2><p><b>{{project.title}}</b> ({{project.no}}), {{entity.name}}</p>{{closeout.table}}<h3>Statement of account</h3>{{soa.table}}<h3>Differences and actions</h3><p>[None]</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Prepared by</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Checked by (accounting)</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(22,22,1,'Project completion and closeout summary','<div>{{letterhead}}</div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">{{doc.no}}<br>{{date.today}}</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0 14px\">PROJECT COMPLETION AND CLOSEOUT SUMMARY</h2><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:32%\">Project</td><td><b>{{project.title}}</b> ({{project.no}})</td></tr><tr><td>Procuring entity</td><td>{{entity.name}}</td></tr><tr><td>Contract</td><td>{{project.contract_ref}}, NOA {{project.noa_ref}}</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty until</td><td>{{project.warranty_until}}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Final figures</h3>{{closeout.table}}<h3>Papers on file</h3>{{requirements.all_table}}<h3>Lessons learned</h3><p>[What went well, what to change next time.]</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{project.pm}}</div><div>Prepared by</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{project.approver}}</div><div>Approved by</div></td></tr></table>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(23,23,1,'Contract agreement: supply and delivery of goods (proforma)','<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">CONTRACT AGREEMENT<br><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Supply and Delivery of Goods</span></h2><p style=\"font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #999;padding:6px\"><i>Company proforma. Where the ENTITY\'s bidding documents prescribe a contract form or general and special conditions of contract, those govern; this proforma is used only as the ENTITY accepts it. Review with counsel before signing.</i></p><p>This Agreement is made on {{project.contract_date}} at {{entity.city}}, {{entity.province}}, by and between:</p><p><b>{{entity.name}}</b>, a government entity with office at {{entity.address}}, represented by <b>{{entity.head_name}}</b>, {{entity.head_position}} (the \"ENTITY\"); and</p><p><b>{{company.name}}</b>, {{company.reg_no}}, with business address at {{company.address}}, TIN {{company.tin}}, represented by <b>{{signatory.name}}</b>, {{signatory.position}} (the \"SUPPLIER\");</p><p><b>WHEREAS</b>, the ENTITY procured <b>{{project.title}}</b> ({{project.reference_no}}) through {{project.mode}} under {{project.regime}}, funded by {{project.funding_source}};</p><p><b>WHEREAS</b>, the ENTITY awarded the contract to the SUPPLIER by Notice of Award {{project.noa_ref}} dated {{project.noa_date}};</p><p><b>NOW, THEREFORE</b>, the parties agree as follows:</p><p><b>1. Contract documents.</b> The following form part of this Agreement and are read together, in this order of precedence: this Agreement; the Notice of Award; the purchase order or notice to proceed; the bid / quotation of the SUPPLIER with its price schedule; the technical specifications or terms of reference; and the general and special conditions issued by the ENTITY, if any.</p><p><b>2. Scope.</b> The SUPPLIER shall supply and deliver the goods as listed below:</p>{{lines.contract_table}}<p><b>3. Contract price.</b> The contract price is <b>{{project.contract_amount}}</b> ({{project.contract_amount_words}}), inclusive of all applicable taxes, duties, delivery and other charges. The ENTITY shall withhold the taxes required by law and issue BIR Form 2307 for them.</p><p><b>4. Period and place.</b> The SUPPLIER shall deliver the goods to {{project.delivery_site}} within {{project.delivery_days}} from receipt of the purchase order / notice to proceed, on or before {{project.due_date}}.</p><p><b>5. Inspection and acceptance.</b> The ENTITY, through its inspection and acceptance committee, shall inspect the deliveries or work and issue its inspection and acceptance report. Items rejected shall be replaced or corrected by the SUPPLIER at its cost within the period the ENTITY sets.</p><p><b>6. Payment.</b> {{project.payment_terms}}. Each billing shall be supported by the sales invoice, statement of account, signed delivery receipts or accomplishment reports and the inspection and acceptance report. A retention of {{project.retention_pct}} of each payment, where applicable, shall be released after the warranty period upon the ENTITY\'s final acceptance.</p><p><b>7. Warranty.</b> The SUPPLIER warrants the goods / work against defects for {{project.warranty_months}} from acceptance and shall correct any defect reported within that period at its cost.</p><p><b>8. Liquidated damages.</b> For each day of delay beyond the agreed period not caused by the ENTITY or by force majeure, the SUPPLIER shall pay liquidated damages of {{project.ld_rate}} of the cost of the unperformed portion, deductible from any amount due.</p><p><b>9. Performance security.</b> Where required by the contract documents, the SUPPLIER shall post the performance security in the form and amount stated there, valid until final acceptance.</p><p><b>10. Changes.</b> No change in quantity, scope, price or period is valid unless approved in writing by the ENTITY\'s authorized official in accordance with the applicable procurement rules.</p><p><b>11. Termination.</b> Either party may terminate this Agreement on the grounds and through the procedures provided by the applicable procurement law, its implementing rules and the contract documents.</p><p><b>12. Governing law and venue.</b> This Agreement is governed by the laws of the Philippines. Disputes shall first be settled amicably; failing that, through the dispute resolution provided by the applicable procurement rules, and the courts of the place of the ENTITY.</p><p><b>13. Entire agreement.</b> This Agreement and the contract documents contain the whole agreement of the parties; amendments are valid only in writing and signed by both.</p><p>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have signed this Agreement on the date and at the place first written above.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{entity.head_name}}</div><div>For the ENTITY: {{entity.head_position}}</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{signatory.name}}</div><div>For the SUPPLIER: {{signatory.position}}</div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:14px\">Signed in the presence of:</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Witness</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Witness</div></td></tr></table><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px\">ACKNOWLEDGMENT</h3><p>Republic of the Philippines )<br>________________________ ) S.S.</p><p>[Notarial acknowledgment to be completed by the notary public.]</p>',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
(24,24,1,'Contract agreement: general services (proforma)','<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">CONTRACT AGREEMENT<br><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">General Services</span></h2><p style=\"font-size:9pt;border:1px solid #999;padding:6px\"><i>Company proforma. Where the ENTITY\'s bidding documents prescribe a contract form or general and special conditions of contract, those govern; this proforma is used only as the ENTITY accepts it. Review with counsel before signing.</i></p><p>This Agreement is made on {{project.contract_date}} at {{entity.city}}, {{entity.province}}, by and between:</p><p><b>{{entity.name}}</b>, a government entity with office at {{entity.address}}, represented by <b>{{entity.head_name}}</b>, {{entity.head_position}} (the \"ENTITY\"); and</p><p><b>{{company.name}}</b>, {{company.reg_no}}, with business address at {{company.address}}, TIN {{company.tin}}, represented by <b>{{signatory.name}}</b>, {{signatory.position}} (the \"SUPPLIER\");</p><p><b>WHEREAS</b>, the ENTITY procured <b>{{project.title}}</b> ({{project.reference_no}}) through {{project.mode}} under {{project.regime}}, funded by {{project.funding_source}};</p><p><b>WHEREAS</b>, the ENTITY awarded the contract to the SUPPLIER by Notice of Award {{project.noa_ref}} dated {{project.noa_date}};</p><p><b>NOW, THEREFORE</b>, the parties agree as follows:</p><p><b>1. Contract documents.</b> The following form part of this Agreement and are read together, in this order of precedence: this Agreement; the Notice of Award; the purchase order or notice to proceed; the bid / quotation of the SUPPLIER with its price schedule; the technical specifications or terms of reference; and the general and special conditions issued by the ENTITY, if any.</p><p><b>2. Scope.</b> The SUPPLIER shall render the services as listed below:</p>{{lines.contract_table}}<p><b>3. Contract price.</b> The contract price is <b>{{project.contract_amount}}</b> ({{project.contract_amount_words}}), inclusive of all applicable taxes, duties, delivery and other charges. The ENTITY shall withhold the taxes required by law and issue BIR Form 2307 for them.</p><p><b>4. Period and place.</b> The services shall be rendered at {{project.delivery_site}} from {{project.start_date}} for {{project.delivery_days}}, under the schedule in the terms of reference. Each period\'s services are certified by the end-user ({{project.end_user}}) through the accomplishment report.</p><p><b>5. Inspection and acceptance.</b> The ENTITY, through its inspection and acceptance committee, shall inspect the deliveries or work and issue its inspection and acceptance report. Items rejected shall be replaced or corrected by the SUPPLIER at its cost within the period the ENTITY sets.</p><p><b>6. Payment.</b> {{project.payment_terms}}. Each billing shall be supported by the sales invoice, statement of account, signed delivery receipts or accomplishment reports and the inspection and acceptance report. A retention of {{project.retention_pct}} of each payment, where applicable, shall be released after the warranty period upon the ENTITY\'s final acceptance.</p><p><b>7. Warranty.</b> The SUPPLIER warrants the goods / work against defects for {{project.warranty_months}} from acceptance and shall correct any defect reported within that period at its cost.</p><p><b>8. Liquidated damages.</b> For each day of delay beyond the agreed period not caused by the ENTITY or by force majeure, the SUPPLIER shall pay liquidated damages of {{project.ld_rate}} of the cost of the unperformed portion, deductible from any amount due.</p><p><b>9. Personnel.</b> The SUPPLIER employs and pays its personnel, complies with labor, social security and safety laws, and remains solely responsible for them; no employer-employee relationship arises between the ENTITY and the SUPPLIER\'s personnel.</p><p><b>10. Changes.</b> No change in quantity, scope, price or period is valid unless approved in writing by the ENTITY\'s authorized official in accordance with the applicable procurement rules.</p><p><b>11. Termination.</b> Either party may terminate this Agreement on the grounds and through the procedures provided by the applicable procurement law, its implementing rules and the contract documents.</p><p><b>12. Governing law and venue.</b> This Agreement is governed by the laws of the Philippines. Disputes shall first be settled amicably; failing that, through the dispute resolution provided by the applicable procurement rules, and the courts of the place of the ENTITY.</p><p><b>13. Entire agreement.</b> This Agreement and the contract documents contain the whole agreement of the parties; amendments are valid only in writing and signed by both.</p><p>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have signed this Agreement on the date and at the place first written above.</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{entity.head_name}}</div><div>For the ENTITY: {{entity.head_position}}</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\">{{signatory.name}}</div><div>For the SUPPLIER: {{signatory.position}}</div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:14px\">Signed in the presence of:</p><table class=\"sig-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:26px\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Witness</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;padding:28px 10px 0 0\"><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000;min-height:22px\"> </div><div>Witness</div></td></tr></table><h3 style=\"margin-top:20px\">ACKNOWLEDGMENT</h3><p>Republic of the Philippines )<br>________________________ ) S.S.</p><p>[Notarial acknowledgment to be completed by the notary public.]</p>',NUL