(31,31,1,'Bid form / price quotation form (prescribed by the entity)','<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">BID FORM / PRICE QUOTATION FORM</h2><div style=\"border:2px solid #b45309;padding:8px;margin:8px 0;background:#fff7ed\"><b>Prescribed form.</b> Paste here the current official text of this form, exactly as issued with the procuring entity\'s bidding documents or RFQ (or the GPPB\'s prescribed version they refer to), without changing its wording. Then fill its blanks with the details below and remove this box. The form cannot be made final until the official version it follows is stated.</div><p>[OFFICIAL TEXT OF THE FORM]</p><h3>Details for the blanks</h3><table class=\"ft\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:36%\">Name of bidder</td><td>{{company.name}}</td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td>{{company.address}}</td></tr><tr><td>Authorized representative</td><td>{{signatory.name}}, {{signatory.position}}</td></tr><tr><td>Procuring entity</td><td>{{entity.name}}</td></tr><tr><td>Project / reference</td><td>{{project.title}} ({{project.reference_no}})</td></tr><tr><td>Total bid</td><td>{{project.bid_amount}} ({{project.bid_amount_words}})</td></tr></tbody></table>{{lines.table}}',NULL,NULL,'Supplied with the program',NULL,'2026-11-10 02:59:42'),
