(3,'BFM-00003',1,1,1,'Cover letter: submission of bid / quotation - BCP-00001','cover_letter',NULL,NULL,'<div><div class=\"fx-letterhead\" style=\"margin-bottom:6mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-lh\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding:0\"><div class=\"lh-text\" style=\"font-family:Cambria, Caladea, Georgia, serif;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;background-color:#b8963e;color:#1b1b1b;border:1px solid #222;padding:2mm 4mm\"><div class=\"lh-line lh-big\" style=\"font-size:20pt;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1\">SAMPLE TRADING COMPANY</div><div class=\"lh-line\">123 RIZAL AVENUE, MAKATI CITY, METRO MANILA</div><div class=\"lh-line\">TEL. NO. (02) 8123-4567</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"lh-rule\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #222222;margin-top:2mm\"></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align:right;margin:0 0 6px\">BFM-00003<br>10 November 2026</p><p><b>Hon. Ricardo M. Santos</b><br>Punong Barangay<br>Barangay San Isidro<br>Barangay Hall, 12 Mabini St., San Isidro, Quezon City</p><p><b>Attention:</b> The Chairperson, Bids and Awards Committee  (Kgd. Maria L. Reyes)</p><p><b>Subject: Submission of bid / quotation for Supply and delivery of office and IT equipment for the barangay hall (RFQ-SI-2026-031)</b></p><p>Dear Sir / Madam:</p><p>In response to your invitation, Sample Trading Company respectfully submits its bid / quotation for <b>Supply and delivery of office and IT equipment for the barangay hall</b> in the total amount of <b>₱278,000.00</b> (Two hundred seventy-eight thousand pesos and 00/100 only), inclusive of all applicable taxes, under the terms and specifications of your request.</p><p>Enclosed are the documents your request asks for, as listed in our checklist:</p><table class=\"ft\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:6%\">No.</th><th>Requirement</th><th style=\"width:13%\">Kind</th><th style=\"width:28%\">Document</th><th style=\"width:14%\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td><td>PhilGEPS registration certificate (Platinum membership where required)</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>PhilGEPS Certificate of Platinum Membership<br><small>valid until 11/30/2026</small></td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td><td>Mayor&#039;s / business permit (current)</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Mayor&#039;s Permit 2026<br><small>valid until 01/27/2027</small></td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">3</td><td>BIR Certificate of Registration (Form 2303)</td><td>Conditional</td><td>BIR Certificate of Registration (Form 2303)</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">4</td><td>Authority of the signatory (secretary&#039;s certificate / special power of attorney)</td><td>Conditional</td><td>Secretary&#039;s Certificate: authority of the President to bid and sign</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">5</td><td>Latest income tax return / business tax returns</td><td>Conditional</td><td>Annual Income Tax Return 2025 (BIR Form 1702)</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">6</td><td>Omnibus sworn statement (prescribed form)</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Omnibus sworn statement (prescribed form)</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">7</td><td>Signed price quotation / bid form (in the form the entity issued)</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Signed price quotation / bid form (in the form the entity issued)</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">8</td><td>Price schedule / bill of quantities</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Price schedule / bill of quantities</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">9</td><td>Technical proposal / statement of compliance with the specifications</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Technical proposal / statement of compliance with the specifications</td><td>In order</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">10</td><td>Brochures and technical data sheets of the products offered</td><td>Optional</td><td></td><td>Not required (waived)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\">11</td><td>Notarized omnibus sworn statement on every purchase (Barangay San Isidro practice)</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>Notarized omnibus sworn statement on every purchase (Barangay San Isidro practice)</td><td>In order</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Our offer is valid for the period stated in your bidding documents. For clarifications, please contact the undersigned at (02) 8123-4567 or accounting@sampletrading.test.</p><div><div class=\"fx-sigs\" style=\"margin-top:6mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-sigrow\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;padding:0 3mm 0 0\"><div class=\"sg-lead\">Very truly yours,</div><div style=\"height:12mm\"></div><div class=\"sg-nm\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">Juan P. Dela Cruz</div><div class=\"sg-ps\">President and General Manager</div><div class=\"sg-ex\">Sample Trading Company</div></td><td style=\"width:50%\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>','A4','portrait',1,'{\"f\":{\"company.name\":\"Sample Trading Company\",\"company.address\":\"123 Rizal Avenue, Makati City, Metro Manila\",\"company.tin\":\"000-123-456-000\",\"company.phone\":\"(02) 8123-4567\",\"company.email\":\"accounting@sampletrading.test\",\"company.reg_no\":\"SEC CS201512345\",\"company.philgeps_no\":\"2015-0012345\",\"company.philgeps_class\":\"Platinum\",\"company.vat_status\":\"VAT registered\",\"company.bank_details\":\"BDO Unibank, Makati Branch, Account Name: Sample Trading Company, Account No. 0012-3456-7890\",\"signatory.name\":\"Juan P. Dela Cruz\",\"signatory.position\":\"President and General Manager\",\"company.name_upper\":\"SAMPLE TRADING COMPANY\",\"doc.no\":\"BFM-00003\",\"date.today\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.today_mdy\":\"November 10, 2026\",\"date.today_dmy\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.today_short\":\"11\\/10\\/2026\",\"signatory.name_upper