(23,'BFM-00023',11,42,1,'Invitation to bid (ITB) - BCP-00011','itb',NULL,NULL,'<div><div class=\"fx-letterhead\" style=\"margin-bottom:5mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-lh\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:33.3mm;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;padding:0 2mm 0 0\"><img src=\"index.php?p=brgy.entities&amp;a=seal&amp;id=3&amp;k=lgu&amp;v=b925259a\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:25mm;max-width:80mm;object-fit:contain\"></td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding:0\"><div class=\"lh-text\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.3;text-align:center\"><div class=\"lh-line\">Republic of the Philippines</div><div class=\"lh-line\">Province of Cebu</div><div class=\"lh-line\">City of Cebu</div><div class=\"lh-line\"><b>BARANGAY LAHUG</b></div></div></td><td style=\"width:33.3mm;vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 0 2mm\"><img src=\"index.php?p=brgy.entities&amp;a=seal&amp;id=3&amp;k=seal&amp;v=5e1d4acc\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:25mm;max-width:80mm;object-fit:contain\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"lh-rule\" style=\"border-top:2px solid #111111;margin-top:2mm\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:12px 0\">INVITATION TO BID</div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Supply and Delivery of Barangay Tanod Equipment</b><br>ITB-LAH-2026-021</p><ol><li>The Barangay Lahug, through its approved budget, intends to apply the sum of <b>Four hundred fifty thousand pesos and 00/100 only (₱450,000.00)</b> being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC) to payments under the contract for Supply and Delivery of Barangay Tanod Equipment. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be automatically rejected at bid opening.</li><li>The Barangay Lahug now invites bids for the above procurement project. Delivery of the goods is required within 30 calendar days. Bidders should have completed a contract similar to the project.</li><li>Bidding will be conducted through open competitive bidding procedures using a non-discretionary \"pass/fail\" criterion as specified in the applicable procurement law and its implementing rules.</li><li>A pre-bid conference shall be held on 7 November 2026, 10:00 AM at Barangay Hall, Gorordo Ave., Lahug, Cebu City.</li><li>Bids must be duly received by the BAC Secretariat at Barangay Hall, Gorordo Ave., Lahug, Cebu City on or before 22 November 2026, 10:00 AM. Late bids shall not be accepted.</li><li>The Barangay Lahug reserves the right to reject any and all bids, declare a failure of bidding, or not award the contract at any time prior to contract award, without thereby incurring any liability to the affected bidder or bidders.</li></ol><div><div class=\"fx-sigs\" style=\"margin-top:12mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-sigrow\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:52%\"></td><td style=\"width:48%;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;padding:0 3mm 0 0\"><div style=\"height:12mm\"></div><div class=\"sg-nm\" style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">KGD. TERESA O. RAMOS</div><div class=\"sg-ps\">BAC Chairman</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>','A4','portrait',0,'{\"f\":{\"company.name\":\"Sample Trading Company\",\"company.address\":\"123 Rizal Avenue, Makati City, Metro Manila\",\"company.tin\":\"000-123-456-000\",\"company.phone\":\"(02) 8123-4567\",\"company.email\":\"accounting@sampletrading.test\",\"company.reg_no\":\"SEC CS201512345\",\"company.philgeps_no\":\"2015-0012345\",\"company.philgeps_class\":\"Platinum\",\"company.vat_status\":\"VAT registered\",\"company.bank_details\":\"BDO Unibank, Makati Branch, Account Name: Sample Trading Company, Account No. 0012-3456-7890\",\"signatory.name\":\"Juan P. Dela Cruz\",\"signatory.position\":\"President and General Manager\",\"company.name_upper\":\"SAMPLE TRADING COMPANY\",\"doc.no\":\"BFM-00023\",\"date.today\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.today_mdy\":\"November 10, 2026\",\"date.today_dmy\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.tod