(25,'BFM-00025',11,43,1,'Letter to COA - BCP-00011','coa_letter',NULL,NULL,'<div><div class=\"fx-letterhead\" style=\"margin-bottom:5mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-lh\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:33.3mm;vertical-align:middle;text-align:left;padding:0 2mm 0 0\"><img src=\"index.php?p=brgy.entities&amp;a=seal&amp;id=3&amp;k=lgu&amp;v=b925259a\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:25mm;max-width:80mm;object-fit:contain\"></td><td style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding:0\"><div class=\"lh-text\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.3;text-align:center\"><div class=\"lh-line\">Republic of the Philippines</div><div class=\"lh-line\">Province of Cebu</div><div class=\"lh-line\">City of Cebu</div><div class=\"lh-line\"><b>BARANGAY LAHUG</b></div></div></td><td style=\"width:33.3mm;vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;padding:0 0 0 2mm\"><img src=\"index.php?p=brgy.entities&amp;a=seal&amp;id=3&amp;k=seal&amp;v=5e1d4acc\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:25mm;max-width:80mm;object-fit:contain\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"lh-rule\" style=\"border-top:2px solid #111111;margin-top:2mm\"></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align:right\">10 November 2026</p><p><b>The Audit Team Leader</b><br>Commission on Audit<br>Cebu City, Cebu</p><p><b>Subject: Invitation to observe the bidding for Supply and Delivery of Barangay Tanod Equipment</b></p><p>Sir/Madam:</p><p>The Bids and Awards Committee of Barangay Lahug respectfully informs your office of the procurement of <b>Supply and Delivery of Barangay Tanod Equipment</b> (ITB-LAH-2026-021) with an Approved Budget for the Contract of ₱450,000.00.</p><p>The pre-bid conference is scheduled on 7 November 2026, 10:00 AM and the opening of bids on 22 November 2026, 10:00 AM, at Barangay Hall, Gorordo Ave., Lahug, Cebu City. We would be glad to have a representative of your office attend as observer.</p><p>Thank you.</p><div><div class=\"fx-sigs\" style=\"margin-top:6mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-sigrow\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left;padding:0 3mm 0 0\"><div class=\"sg-lead\">Very truly yours,</div><div style=\"height:12mm\"></div><div class=\"sg-nm\" style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">KGD. TERESA O. RAMOS</div><div class=\"sg-ps\">BAC Chairman</div></td><td style=\"width:50%\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>','A4','portrait',0,'{\"f\":{\"company.name\":\"Sample Trading Company\",\"company.address\":\"123 Rizal Avenue, Makati City, Metro Manila\",\"company.tin\":\"000-123-456-000\",\"company.phone\":\"(02) 8123-4567\",\"company.email\":\"accounting@sampletrading.test\",\"company.reg_no\":\"SEC CS201512345\",\"company.philgeps_no\":\"2015-0012345\",\"company.philgeps_class\":\"Platinum\",\"company.vat_status\":\"VAT registered\",\"company.bank_details\":\"BDO Unibank, Makati Branch, Account Name: Sample Trading Company, Account No. 0012-3456-7890\",\"signatory.name\":\"Juan P. Dela Cruz\",\"signatory.position\":\"President and General Manager\",\"company.name_upper\":\"SAMPLE TRADING COMPANY\",\"doc.no\":\"BFM-00025\",\"date.today\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.today_mdy\":\"November 10, 2026\",\"date.today_dmy\":\"10 November 2026\",\"date.today_short\":\"11\\/10\\/2026\",\"signatory.name_upper\":\"JUAN P. DELA CRUZ\",\"signatory.position_upper\":\"PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER\",\"signatory.addressee\":\"MR. JUAN P. DELA CRUZ\",\"signatory.salutation\":\"Mr. J. Dela Cruz\",\"signatory.mobile\":\"0917 555 0142\",\"company.address_upper\":\"123 RIZAL AVENUE, MAKATI CITY, METRO MANILA\",\"company.manager\":\"Juan P. Dela Cruz\",\"company.manager_upper\":\"JUAN P. DELA CRUZ\",\"company.manager_position\":\"President and General Manager\",\"company.manager_phone\":\"(02) 8123-4567\",\"company.manager_mobile\":\"0917 555 0142\",\"company.liaison\":\"Ana M. Reyes\",\"company.liaison_upper\":\"ANA M. REYES\",\"company.liaison_position\":\"Liaison Officer\",\"compa