(27,'BFM-00027',11,45,1,'Special power of attorney (SPA) - BCP-00011','spa',NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"fx-title\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:6px 0 14px\">SPECIAL POWER OF ATTORNEY</div><p><b>KNOW ALL MEN BY THESE PRESENTS:</b></p><p>I, <b>Juan P. Dela Cruz</b>, of legal age, Filipino, President and General Manager of <b>Sample Trading Company</b>, with business address at 123 Rizal Avenue, Makati City, Metro Manila, do hereby name, constitute and appoint <b>Rosa Dizon</b>, of legal age, as my true and lawful attorney-in-fact, for me and in my name, place and stead, to do and perform the following acts:</p><ol><li>To attend the pre-bid conference and the opening of bids of <b>Supply and Delivery of Barangay Tanod Equipment</b> (ITB-LAH-2026-021) of the Barangay Lahug;</li><li>To submit, sign and receive all documents relative to the said bidding, including the bid, clarifications and notices;</li><li>To do all acts necessary and incidental to the foregoing.</li></ol><p>HEREBY GIVING AND GRANTING unto my said attorney-in-fact full power and authority to do and perform the acts above, and hereby ratifying all that my said attorney-in-fact shall lawfully do by virtue hereof.</p><p>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have hereunto set my hand this ____ day of __________ at __________.</p><div><div class=\"fx-sigs\" style=\"margin-top:12mm\"><table class=\"fx-plain fx-sigrow\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;padding:0 3mm 0 0\"><div style=\"height:12mm\"></div><div class=\"sg-nm\" style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">Juan P. Dela Cruz</div><div class=\"sg-ps\">Principal</div></td><td style=\"width:50%;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;padding:0 3mm 0 0\"><div style=\"height:12mm\"></div><div class=\"sg-nm\" style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">Rosa Dizon</div><div class=\"sg-ps\">Attorney-in-fact</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:22px\